{"4400190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KILLGUN", "steam_appid": 4400190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4675380], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>KILLGUN</strong> is a brutal first-person shooter focused on fast, unforgiving action and pure survival.</i></h2>The game throws players into a dark and violent world where chaos reigns and every mistake can be fatal. KILLGUN delivers an intense single-player experience built around relentless combat, heavy atmosphere, and high difficulty.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Key Features:</strong></i></h2><strong>Intense Single-Player Action:</strong><br>KILLGUN is designed around nonstop combat where reflexes, accuracy, and smart weapon usage are essential. Enemies are aggressive, numerous, and show no mercy.<br><br><strong>Zombies and Hostile Creatures:</strong><br>Face waves of zombies and other dangerous enemies, each with distinct behaviors and attack patterns. As you progress, the challenges become increasingly brutal.<br><br><strong>Wide Weapon Arsenal:</strong><br>Use a diverse selection of firearms, from classic assault rifles and shotguns to powerful tools of destruction. Adapt your loadout to your playstyle and the situation at hand.<br><br><strong>Dark and Atmospheric Locations:</strong><br>Fight through tense, hostile environments - abandoned urban zones, industrial facilities, and ruined locations filled with constant danger. Each level is crafted to enhance pressure and immersion.<br><br><strong>Hardcore Gameplay:</strong><br>KILLGUN does not hold your hand. Limited resources, relentless enemies, and high difficulty demand tactical thinking and fast decision-making.<br><br><strong>Gritty Visuals and Sound Design:</strong><br>The game delivers a raw and oppressive atmosphere through harsh visual effects, bloody details, and intense sound design that amplifies every encounter.<br>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>KILLGUN</strong>